   196	The body-sensitivity probe is:
   197	
   198	```bash
   199	kprove spec-body-mutation.k \
   200	  --definition verification-kompiled \
   201	  --spec-module SPEC-BODY-MUTATION
   202	```
   203	
   204	It exited 1 with `WarnStuckClaimState`; after changing the body to
   205	`return arr`, the residual had `ref(0)` while the original destination required
   206	`ref(2)`.  `prove.sh` recorded:
   207	
   208	```text
